Terima kasih atas jamuan itu, Encik Lin.

00:06:42.360 --> 00:06:43.300
Kita akan keluar sekarang.

00:06:43.960 --> 00:06:45.260
Hujan turun.
Korang ada payung ke?

00:06:45.440 --> 00:06:46.000
Ya, kami baik-baik saja.

00:06:46.060 --> 00:06:47.480
Yuhua melihat ramalan cuaca dan membawa satu.

00:06:48.500 --> 00:06:49.159
Jom pergi.

00:06:49.500 --> 00:06:50.580
Xiguang tidak mempunyainya.

00:06:51.060 --> 00:06:51.780
Jangan risau.

00:06:51.880 --> 00:06:52.659
Jom bergerak.

00:06:53.760 --> 00:06:54.440
Kita bertolak.

00:06:55.340 --> 00:06:56.120
- Selamat tinggal.
- Jumpa lagi.

00:06:57.760 --> 00:06:58.340
Selamat tinggal.

